{"id":"n14953-1-9","stage":2,"title":"두려움 · 恐惧","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14953-1-9-1","ko":"다음 달에 유학 간다면서? 좋겠다.","zh":"听说下个月就要去留学了？真不错啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"다음","meaning":"以后，下次","explanation":"다음：以后，下次","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"5","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}},{"text":"달에","meaning":"月","explanation":"달：月；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"달","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62266","senseId":"2","lemma":"달","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"달에","audio":"/audio/0f8e45b47a9b54bf0acc.mp3"}},{"text":"유학","meaning":"留学","explanation":"유학：留学","readings":[{"term":"유학","audio":"/audio/4c52a19db898d399dde7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70244","senseId":"1","lemma":"유학","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유학","audio":"/audio/4c52a19db898d399dde7.mp3"}},{"text":"간다면서?","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；ㄴ다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"간다면서","audio":"/audio/697bef08b13e91212e3e.mp3"}},{"text":"좋겠다.","meaning":"好，高兴，愉快","explanation":"좋다：好，高兴，愉快；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"11","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋겠다","audio":"/audio/662bbd805e871b1915e9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"以后，下次","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"一段时间后。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"2f941e6eb2150679","term":"달","zh":"月","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3","entryId":"62266","definition":"把一年分为十二个的每个时间段。","pronunciation":["달"]},{"id":"4c52a19db898d399","term":"유학","zh":"留学","audio":"/audio/4c52a19db898d399dde7.mp3","entryId":"70244","definition":"在外国生活并学习。","pronunciation":["유학"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，高兴，愉快","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"感情等很愉悦、很满足。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/39ed8dc3f92ed9cff790.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14953-1-9-2","ko":"기대 반 두려움 반이야.","zh":"既期待又有些害怕呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"기대","meaning":"期待，期望","explanation":"기대：期待，期望","readings":[{"term":"기대","audio":"/audio/dad60f61ab1e45904172.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62483","senseId":"1","lemma":"기대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기대","audio":"/audio/dad60f61ab1e45904172.mp3"}},{"text":"반","meaning":"一半，半","explanation":"반：一半，半","readings":[{"term":"반","audio":"/audio/9f12e26e8d4c016af246.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57623","senseId":"1","lemma":"반","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반","audio":"/audio/9f12e26e8d4c016af246.mp3"}},{"text":"두려움","meaning":"恐惧，畏惧","explanation":"두려움：恐惧，畏惧","readings":[{"term":"두려움","audio":"/audio/32cc4cd39ea22c224a7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14953","senseId":"1","lemma":"두려움","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"두려움","audio":"/audio/32cc4cd39ea22c224a7c.mp3"}},{"text":"반이야.","meaning":"一半，半","explanation":"반：一半，半；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"반","audio":"/audio/9f12e26e8d4c016af246.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57623","senseId":"1","lemma":"반","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반이야","audio":"/audio/03b60b1215